# SEO & Landing Page Audit

When the user asks for any of the following (or similar), run a **full SEO and landing page audit** of the mobile app codebase:

- "audit for SEO and landing page"
- "extract every user-facing feature and string"
- "SEO audit" / "landing page content audit"
- "marketable elements" / "keyword seeds for SEO"
- "run the SEO audit prompt" / "use the audit prompt"

**What to do:**

1. Read and follow the instructions in **`docs/prompts/SEO_LANDING_PAGE_AUDIT_PROMPT.md`** (the full scope and output format are defined there).
2. Systematically extract: strings/copy, screens & flows, features & capabilities, settings & options, technical differentiators, and raw keyword seeds.
3. Do not skip or summarize away detail; include every screen, major string group, and feature. If in doubt, include it.
4. Output in the copy-paste friendly format specified in that prompt (Strings/copy, Screens & flows, Features & capabilities, Settings & options, Technical differentiators, Raw keyword seeds).

The user can also **copy-paste the prompt** from `docs/prompts/SEO_LANDING_PAGE_AUDIT_PROMPT.md` into any chat to run the same audit again.
